<title>CHINA: Hang Seng Bank interim net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Hang Seng Bank interim net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   258   vs 225</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    140   vs 126</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    4,982 vs 4,351</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hang Seng Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Aug 29-Sept 5</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Sept 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Hang Seng Bank is 63.61 percent owned by HSBC Holdings Plc as in May 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
